              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डुबोना — ḍubonā — \"to dip; to immerse\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भक्तों ने फूल पानी में डुबोए। bhaktoṁ ne phūl pānī meṁ ḍuboe. The devotees dipped flowers in the water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने कपड़ा पानी में डुबोया, usne kapṛā pānī meṁ ḍuboyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
