          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डुबोना (ḍubonā) is the causative of डूबना, to sink, which CDIAL 5561 sets under ḍubb: to make something go under the water."
            }
          ]
